Description: lokahostcp web terminal
 lokahostcp is an open source hosting control panel.
 lokahostcp has a clean and focused interface without the clutter.
 lokahostcp has the latest of very innovative technologies.
 lokahostcp is a fork from VestaCP, special thanks to vestacp.com and Serghey Rodin
